Output docs/demo/energon-agent-demo/assets/terminal.mp4

Require bash

Set Shell "bash"
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set FontSize 22
Set TypingSpeed 28ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 28
Set Framerate 30

Hide
Type "bash docs/assets/energon-agent-demo.sh"
Enter
Show

Wait+Screen@5s /›/
Type "Publish the onboarding flow prototype to Energon and post the link to #design in Slack."
Sleep 400ms
Enter

Wait+Screen@5s /Posted the link to #design in Slack/
Sleep 5s
